		(property "Note" "MEZZANINE (OQ-77) Hub side, owner directive 2026-07-15: THT + DNP -- facing chosen at assembly (up = normal stack, down = SANDWICH: Hub flipped onto the 24-pin, components between boards). COLUMN-PAIRED map (both rows of a column carry one signal: 5V|5V|GND|CANH|CANL|DETECT1|GND|GND) = flip-invariant about the header long axis, so BOTH facings mate -- CONTRACT: 24-pin rev3 J6 must move to the conjugate column-paired map (owner-queue; its layout is unstarted). 5V pins tie to +5VSB rail: the 24-pin feeds PRE-MUXED +5V_SYS; the Hub's TPS2121s block reverse." (at 355.6 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
